ed way or not..      <br />        <br />          To cite BioModels Database, please use:      <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/20587024\" target=\"_blank\">Li C, Donizelli M, Rodriguez N, Dharuri H, Endler L, Chelliah V, Li L, He E, Henry A, Stefan MI, Snoep JL, Hucka M, Le Novère N, Laibe C (2010) BioModels Database: An enhanced, curated and annotated resource for published quantitative kinetic models. BMC Syst Biol., 4:92.</a></p>      </body>    </notes>",
